OL,5,G1055 Agatha Christie's Poirot
OL,6,     FHercule Poirot, a famous Belgian
OL,7,     Fdetective, who has a knack for
OL,8,     Fgetting embroiled in a mystery,
OL,9,     Fsolves crimes along with Captain
OL,10,     FHastings and Scotland Yard Chief
OL,11,     FInspector.
OL,12,G1200 Don't Look Back In Anger
OL,13,     FIn a series of 20 half hours, we
OL,14,     Fchronicle the news and highlights
OL,15,     Fof the last 20 years in this
OL,16,     Farchive and music-based series.
